# This file records external code incorporated into this project.
# New, original code is CC0-1.0 and is not listed here.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  External sources incorporated into yarn-spinner-runner-ts. Language and
  behavior parity target: Yarn Spinner 3.2.x (algorithms and diagnostics
  mirrored; TypeScript reimplementation unless noted as a code borrow).
title: yarn-spinner-runner-ts external sources
references:
  - type: software
    title: YarnSpinner
    authors:
      - name: Yarn Spinner Pty. Ltd.
      - name: Secret Lab Pty. Ltd.
      - name: Yarn Spinner contributors
    version: v3.2.2 (commit 5b3a4ff2d24e4f727e3f90fee5d8ce637474c305)
    date-released: "2026-08-11"
    license: MIT
    urls:
      - https://github.com/YarnSpinnerTool/YarnSpinner
    notes: >-
      Incorporated as the conformance-corpus git submodule pinned at the
      v3.2.2 tag (test/fixtures/upstream/YarnSpinner; see the corpus
      PROVENANCE.md and the bump-upstream skill for the pin's history).
      src/compile/crc32.ts adapts YarnSpinner/CRC32.cs (standard CRC-32,
      little-endian hex formatting for implicit line IDs).
      src/compile/tagLines.ts ports YarnSpinner.Compiler/Utility.cs
      (Utility.TagLines) and the LineTaggers/ generators (ILineTagGenerator,
      RandomLineTagGenerator, DescriptiveLineTagGenerator) at v3.2.2 —
      including the Descriptive insertion/generation algorithm and message
      texts (the fork keeps the preceeding-dialogue typo verbatim).
      src/markup/lineParser.ts and src/markup/builtInReplacer.ts adapt
      YarnSpinner/YarnSpinner.Markup/LineParser.cs at v3.2.2 (markup
      parity edges, 2026-09-04: duplicate-property throw per
      MarkupAttribute's Dictionary.Add, the escaped-quote string lexer's
      failed-Match fallback, the invalid-name diagnostic range, and the
      plural/ordinal `%` current-culture rendering); src/markup/types.ts
      adapts MarkupAttribute.Shift (MarkupParseResult.cs).
      src/compile/declarationFile.ts adapts the same file's
      Utility.GenerateYarnFileWithDeclarations at v3.2.2 over the port's
      VariableDeclaration shape. src/compile/upgrader.ts ports
      YarnSpinner.Compiler/Upgrader/LanguageUpgrader.cs (UpgradeJob,
      UpgradeResult/OutputFile, TextReplacement, ApplyReplacements) at
      v3.2.2, including the upgrade-type-unsupported error and the
      replacement mismatch/out-of-range error texts. Other
      compiler and runtime behavior is a parity-driven reimplementation of
      the documented upstream algorithms (string table, shadow-line
      validation, diagnostics registry), not a code borrow.
      Accessed 2026-09-02 (crc32.ts), 2026-09-03 (tagLines.ts, submodule
      mount), 2026-09-04 (declarationFile.ts, markup parity edges),
      2026-09-05 (upgrader.ts).
  - type: software
    title: YarnSpinner-Unity
    authors:
      - name: Yarn Spinner Pty. Ltd.
      - name: Yarn Spinner contributors
    version: main
    date-released: "2026-09-03"
    license: MIT
    urls:
      - https://github.com/YarnSpinnerTool/YarnSpinner-Unity
    notes: >-
      src/compile/stringsFile.ts ports the 8-column CSV strings-file
      contract: Runtime/YarnProject/StringTableEntry.cs
      (ParseFromCSV/CreateCSV record shape and column order),
      Editor/Importers/YarnProjectImporter.cs (entry building from the
      string table — shadow-line exclusion, GenerateCommentWithLineMetadata's
      "Line metadata: " comment), and Editor/Importers/YarnImporter.cs
      GetHashString (the first-8-hex SHA-256 lock).
      Accessed 2026-09-03.
